 "sentences": [
  "Nearly 77,000 fans packed into Wembley Stadium.",
  "This was the 1999 Second Division play-off final.",
  "Manchester City faced Gillingham to decide who earned promotion.",
  "It was Gillingham’s first time playing at the famous stadium.",
  "Manchester City had already played there 11 times before.",
  "Mark Halsey refereed the match, which stayed scoreless until the 81st minute.",
  "Carl Asaba finally broke the deadlock for Gillingham."
